Agent Notch for Windows: the fork crates (windows/agentnotch-* in Agent Notch)

agentnotch-engine, agentnotch-proto, agentnotch-win, agentnotch-hook and
agentnotch-release are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
LICENSE beside this file). The rest of windows/ is Codenotch for Windows under
its own MIT licence (see windows/LICENSE and the LICENSE file at the repository
root).

These crates are a Rust port, for Windows, of ClaudeControl
(Packages/ClaudeControl in Agent Notch), which is derived from:

- Superpowered Vibe Notch (https://github.com/paraswtf/superpowered-vibe-notch),
  a fork of Vibe Notch by paraswtf.

- Vibe Notch, previously Claude Island (https://github.com/farouqaldori/vibe-notch),
  Copyright 2025 Farouq Aldori, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The port is Copyright 2026 paraswtf, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.
